Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,After being pushed this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have been enlightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:01:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me realize
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:02.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,that even a heartless person
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot escape the Life and Death reincarnation cycle !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.59,0:02:10.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reincarnation cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.45,0:02:13.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the Dao of Life and Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:25.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is this possible !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Dao of reincarnation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:18.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,ruthlessness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and heartlessness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,are separated by only a thin line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:26.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that's what made the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Domain battles
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.22,0:03:32.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,between cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:36.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,are just them proving their own Dao to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:37.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this battle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,was won by Ceng Niu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:42.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor is right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:44.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,but Red Butterfly is also impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,as she achieved enlightenment from this loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I could have reached Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:53.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,even the reincarnation cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:56.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,would be suppressed by ruthlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,However
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't lost yet !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:03.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Four Spirits Killing Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:11.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:16.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the day I complete the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:20.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Metal spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if I need to sacrifice my 4 spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.05,0:04:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:32.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,My 3 spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:33.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,explode together !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:37.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since my soul was injured
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.28,0:04:40.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,my cultivation has fallen to Early stage Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:41.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly's attack
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,will greatly injure me even if I survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:47.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is mutual destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,the outcome Zhuque Zi is looking for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only gamble once
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to see if he will intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:57.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,then we both die !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:00.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's see that !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.32,0:05:15.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,The outcome of this duel is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:18.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are a disciple of Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,under the Immortal's Path Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will grant you one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you desire ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Feel free to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll give you half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:48.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where there is mercy, there is forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.61,0:05:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This duel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:58.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,has drained you both greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.31,0:06:00.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,you both need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:37.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,What exactly does Zhuque Zi want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:42.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1660,497)\fad(300,300)}Forbidden area\NCountry of Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:44.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,The competition to become the 15th generation Suzaku is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:46.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:49.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,how are the preparations going ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:50.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,disciple is diligently following your teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:57.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:00.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,your furnace escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:02.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this true ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.01,0:07:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zi Xin must have been freed by someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.18,0:07:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,They broke my restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:11.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,so their cultivation must surpass mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,This matter isn’t simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:15.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will find the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't bother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:19.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't have to look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:22.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your master has found
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,a better furnace candidate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The type of furnace I need is rare...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is Ancestor referring to ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:35.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the duel between Red Butterfly and Ceng Niu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:37.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,both their domains
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:39.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,have evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But their souls
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,have been severely injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:47.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can devour Red Butterfly’s spiritual energy and domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,completely absorb
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:54.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,her Ruthless Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,your chance of reaching Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:01.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,will increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did the Ancestor take her in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:05.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,just for me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:07.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,must not disappoint me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is a bit regrettable
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,that we must do this to Red Butterfly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your master is getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:27.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't bear
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:30.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to do certain things anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:31.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,That way the title of Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't be passed to an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:38.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will be me or Junior Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:39.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:42.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:43.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:53.55,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1670,500)\fad(300,300)}Red Butterfly's cave\NCountry of Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:01.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll grant your wish for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is it !?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:27.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm Qian Feng,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,we met earlier today...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want your domain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:37.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,and your four elemental spirits !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,How ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qing He,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:53.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you cannot help her overcome her fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:56.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly will be dead
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:58.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,by the end of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:01.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,What she predicted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:04.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,was this death...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:39.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did Senior Brother succeed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:45.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:47.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,she is my cultivation furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.19,0:10:49.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,I named her Heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:53.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your breakthrough, Senior Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:56.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,When will I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:10:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,be like you, Senior Brother ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.59,0:11:04.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.22,0:11:13.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heartless is the third person whose domain I’ve devoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:14.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,one day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will become my furnace too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.99,0:11:20.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:23.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,will become the next Suzaku !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s a pity that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,there can only be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,one Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:40.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple is listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You cultivate the Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that only your last illusion is missing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need to find a profound domain
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,and devour it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:56.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,By transforming it into your final illusion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:58.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.29,0:12:00.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,will reach completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,The original person I prepared for you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:07.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,was Zhou Yi from the Five Elements Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:10.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,His Craze Domain was extremely rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:12.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.59,0:12:16.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,this person completely disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.83,0:12:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,within the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:21.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.69,0:12:25.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple will create more avatars
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:26.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and descend the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.75,0:12:28.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,to comprehend the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:32.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,You once had an avatar
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:36.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the country of Zhao, under the Xuan Dao Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,During a sect competition
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:41.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,you met a disciple from the Heng Yue Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:44.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,named Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you remember him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:48.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Him ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:54.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:56.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,is Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:12:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,He
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:02.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the person I found for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly’s Dao heart was shattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:07.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,leaving no room for improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Wang Lin is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:12.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must watch him closely
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,and when his domain is ripe,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:17.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must refine him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.39,0:13:18.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,into your cultivation furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:21.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,When that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:23.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,his Life and Death Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,At that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,compared to Feng’er
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:32.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will be even more likely
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:34.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,to inherit the title of Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple obeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:52.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,He was the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,who resisted my avatar’s charm constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just 500 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:59.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,he’s caught the eye of the Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man isn't simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:05.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should take this chance
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:07.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,to leave a mark in his heart
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:10.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,for future use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:14.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:16.00,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1663,494)}Main hall\NCountry of Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will enter seclusion with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:18.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,more and more tattoo puppets have infiltrated the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Forsaken Immortal Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be plotting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:29.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must conserve our strength
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.88,0:14:31.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,to prepare for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:32.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:35.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,remember Yunque Zi ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:41.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he the one
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,who competed with you for the title of 14th Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:47.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,after failing to seize the position,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:52.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,he began wandering planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I thought he had given up on fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,but unexpectedly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,he secretly trained his own disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,His goal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the title of Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:11.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,must never fall to Yunque Zi's faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:13.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that clear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:15.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:17.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,since you released Qian Feng's furnace, Zi Xin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,and took her under your wing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means you are declaring war...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:30.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't spare a single one
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,of your 4 disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:40.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,we've fought throughout our entire lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:44.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:46.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,then let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,if it's your disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,or my chosen candidates
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,that will prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:25.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although Zhuque Zi promised my safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:32.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly is still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Immortal's Path Sect is acting suspiciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,They cannot be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,My injuries are severe
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,so the priority now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.35,0:16:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to return to Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:44.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,to find a secluded place to recover
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and breakthrough to Late stage Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:54.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Transfer shift !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:58.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if I must self-destruct my Origin Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:16:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will send you to your death !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:12.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of formation is this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:22.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:25.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promised to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:26.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,I kept
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,my word...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:32.89,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1668,501)\fad(300,300)}Far North\Nof the Suzaku continent
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:37.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:40.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’ve finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.15,0:17:42.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Transformation old monster ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.15,0:17:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:48.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Yuanfeng, Suzerain of Xue Yue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here on behalf of Red Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,to take your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard that Xue Yue
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,was forcefully raised to a rank 5 cultivation country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:01.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,7 Soul Formation Elders
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:04.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,went to Suzaku with Red Butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,By using an unorthodox technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,only one survived
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and reached Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I assume that’s you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:18.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the opportunity given by Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:20.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I cannot forget my roots...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:25.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,You severed Red Butterfly’s arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Red Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:29.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the hope of Xue Yue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,For both personal and public reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:36.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not let you live another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:38.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I face a Soul Transformation now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:40.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I stand no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:49.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even with my soul injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.18,0:18:51.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should still be able to open spatial rifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:54.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have set a formation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:57.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spatial rifts
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Star Compass
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:03.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:07.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh... right,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:08.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:11.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The formation also prevents teleportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:14.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is called
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heaven-Sealing Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,this time
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Still refusing to give up ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:36.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Tai,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,come quickly !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another Soul Transformation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:51.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,as I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:53.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,today
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:56.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the day you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:23.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:25.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:34.56,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:34.56,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:42.16,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:42.16,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:49.72,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:49.72,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:53.04,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:53.04,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:56.76,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:56.76,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:21:00.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:04.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:08.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:12.32,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:12.32,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:17.28,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:17.28,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:20.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:23.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:27.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:31.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:36.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:41.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:45.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:50.28,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:50.28,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:53.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:58.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:01.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:06.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:10.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:13.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:16.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:20.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:25.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
